{
 "part": "script/script_0028",
 "entries": [
  {
   "key": "script:0028:1C25",
   "src": "d26c02c6a3d8",
   "t": "<FACE:04>Este… este…<NL>¿Qué hago ahora?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:1C87",
   "src": "e692046038d4",
   "t": "<FACE:04>Uhh… no funciona"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:1C90",
   "src": "5fba9dfd5cdd",
   "t": "<FACE:06>¡No te deprimas ahora!<NL>¡Hay que hacer algo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:1CB1",
   "src": "3af635c0399c",
   "t": "<FACE:0A>Señor Shiden… Desde<NL>el Medabot espacial…<WAIT>Desde que conoció a<NL><PLAYER>, actúa raro…<WAIT><FACE:0B>¿Qué le pasa, señor?<NL><WAIT><PLAYER> fue el único<NL>que oyó su voz…<WAIT>¿Es porque hay datos<NL>que usted ignora?<WAIT>¿Tan poca confianza<NL>se tiene usted?<WAIT><FACE:0A>Antes usted era otro…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:1D61",
   "src": "f868daaa50a4",
   "t": "<FACE:0E>Por eso hasta Rainy…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:1D74",
   "src": "5bacf3052a2a",
   "t": "<FACE:05>Es inútil, Fubuki<NL>Déjalo, sigamos solos…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:1D95",
   "src": "edd885e67d39",
   "t": "<FACE:10>Baja la palanca"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:1DA1",
   "src": "4b16425f768e",
   "t": "<FACE:00>¿Shiden…?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:1DAB",
   "src": "e9bed8ad7ef4",
   "t": "<FACE:10>¿No me oíste?<NL><WAIT>Digo que bajes la<NL>palanca que ves ahí<WAIT>Hasta tú puedes<NL>entender eso, ¿no?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:1DF4",
   "src": "587da068bce6",
   "t": "<FACE:10>¡La llave!<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:1DFC",
   "src": "7222e9f2a6ed",
   "t": "<FACE:10>Quita el seguro con<NL>ella y baja la palanca"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:1E1D",
   "src": "800560ceea91",
   "t": "<FACE:03>¡Uah!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:1E23",
   "src": "5871879ed12a",
   "t": "<FACE:06>¡¿Qué estás haciendo?!<NL>¡¡Ay, de verdad!!<WAIT><FACE:53>Iniciando cuenta<NL>regresiva…<WAIT>Entrada al campo de<NL>gravedad en 10…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:1E64",
   "src": "520a88decab2",
   "t": "<FACE:05>¡Todos, a buscarla!<NL>¡Rápido!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:1E76",
   "src": "464f8e48f535",
   "t": "<FACE:06>¡Tú también!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:1E7F",
   "src": "942e600d91f5",
   "t": "<FACE:10>Hmpf<WAIT><FACE:53>8…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:1E8B",
   "src": "2cbc8e73265c",
   "t": "<FACE:1C>¡Aquí está!<NL>¡La encontré, líder!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:1E9C",
   "src": "30c9635b9ff9",
   "t": "<FACE:06>¡Rápido, dásela a<NL><PLAYER>!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:1EB0",
   "src": "f7de9bc3c800",
   "t": "<FACE:06>…<PLAYER><NL>¡Ahora no la sueltes!<WAIT><FACE:01>¡Ya lo sé!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:1ED1",
   "src": "2ec17ad90a32",
   "t": "<FACE:53>5…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:1ED8",
   "src": "6ebb3437c4d4",
   "t": "<FACE:06>¡Rápido!<NL>¿Todavía no?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:1EE5",
   "src": "c4d9e3b69ad5",
   "t": "<FACE:01>Perdón… está duro…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:1EF6",
   "src": "7bfb2d2090ac",
   "t": "<FACE:06>¡Todos! ¡Ayúdenlo!<WAIT><FACE:53>3…<DELAY:0032><NL><END>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:1F11",
   "src": "f01f50c066b8",
   "t": "<FACE:01>¡Uno, dos… ya!<WAIT><FACE:53>2…<DELAY:0032><NL><WAIT>1…<DELAY:0032><NL><END>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:1F2D",
   "src": "2c8168264b2b",
   "t": "<FACE:04>(¿No llegamos<NL>a tiempo…?)"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:1F42",
   "src": "1d5bb8586601",
   "t": "<FACE:02>Nos… nos salvamos…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:1F53",
   "src": "45a4b71f6972",
   "t": "<FACE:05>Qué patético<NL><WAIT>Por algo así…<WAIT><FACE:16>¡Creí que era el fin!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:1F7E",
   "src": "4a3f6523bba6",
   "t": "<FACE:19>¡Lo logró, líder!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:1F8F",
   "src": "f52cba3e3502",
   "t": "<FACE:0C>Bah, no fue para tanto"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:1F9B",
   "src": "d6d5f262c0ef",
   "t": "<FACE:04>¿Shiden?<WAIT><FACE:0F>…En todo caso<NL><WAIT>Aún no hay forma de<NL>recuperar el control<WAIT>Además, no renuncio<NL>a tu secreto todavía<WAIT>Hasta cumplir mi meta<NL>no me apartaré de ti"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2014",
   "src": "4570f2c5ad82",
   "t": "<FACE:15>¡Ni de broma!<NL>¡Nadie andará contigo!<WAIT><FACE:1A>¡Eso es!<NL>¡No es ninguna broma!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:204E",
   "src": "9ad11e79770d",
   "t": "<FACE:1A>…Oiga, líder"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2064",
   "src": "69d1f4391bd2",
   "t": "<FACE:03>Eh… este… bueno…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2073",
   "src": "7e51320e3254",
   "t": "<FACE:00>Entonces…<NL><WAIT>También tenemos<NL>condiciones, Shiden"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2094",
   "src": "ea8945668c91",
   "t": "<FACE:10>¿Qué cosa?<WAIT><FACE:01>Si vamos juntos,<NL>¡somos compañeros!<WAIT>¡Y no pensamos andar<NL>con quien no lo sea!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:20F1",
   "src": "af0a0815694e",
   "t": "<FACE:12>Compañeros…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:20FB",
   "src": "74865d577f7e",
   "t": "<FACE:0F>Eso…<NL><WAIT>Eso depende de si<NL>ustedes lo creen así<WAIT><FACE:01>¿Entonces aceptas la<NL>condición?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:212E",
   "src": "95e81ea33291",
   "t": "<FACE:11>Está bien<NL><WAIT>Entonces desde ahora<NL>somos compañeros"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2148",
   "src": "431cd722a7f2",
   "t": "<FACE:06>Si lo dices tú,<NL>¡no te creo nada!<WAIT><FACE:15>¡Yo opino igual!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2170",
   "src": "551e17f7f898",
   "t": "<FACE:1D>¡Yo igual!…<NL>Oiga, líder…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2183",
   "src": "e29b04f2b432",
   "t": "<FACE:00>¿Tú crees? Yo le creo"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2195",
   "src": "f8a012f5b5d1",
   "t": "<FACE:00>Voy a perder el<NL>sentido de dirección<WAIT><FACE:05>Parece un laberinto…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:21B8",
   "src": "edfa0908d4ea",
   "t": "<FACE:00>Aun así, hay que<NL>seguir, ¿no?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:21C9",
   "src": "33ae70480772",
   "t": "<FACE:0A>En estos casos solo<NL>queda ir más adentro"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:21E9",
   "src": "0419500d4600",
   "t": "<FACE:19>¡Espéreme, líder!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:21FA",
   "src": "1f6dba1a1abf",
   "t": "<FACE:14>¡Yo también voy!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2206",
   "src": "81a7942d0ec5",
   "t": "<FACE:05>Qué andar tan lleno<NL>de confianza, ¿no?<WAIT><FACE:02>Fubuki casi siempre<NL>rebosa confianza"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:223B",
   "src": "b2cc3d4a4ff5",
   "t": "<FACE:09>Y eso también es<NL>un problema…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:224F",
   "src": "aa5ac6226283",
   "t": "<FACE:05>Da igual; sigámoslos<NL>para no separarnos"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2273",
   "src": "f26d7d9508f1",
   "t": "<FACE:2A>¡Hmpf!<WAIT><FACE:2B>Al fin llegaron, ¿eh?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2288",
   "src": "bf9442e282e1",
   "t": "<FACE:05>¿Y ustedes qué hacían<NL>en un lugar así?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:22A0",
   "src": "ac6a0d11b4b1",
   "t": "<FACE:2F>…Je, je, je"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:22A8",
   "src": "92194d140a64",
   "t": "<FACE:06>¡Q… qué pasa!<NL><WAIT>Dijeron «¡lo haremos<NL>solos!» ¡y son más!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2341",
   "src": "a41cd9a58337",
   "t": "<FACE:0A>Y estarán aquí por<NL>alguna razón, ¿no?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2361",
   "src": "44702efd9236",
   "t": "<FACE:2B>Pues sí… Ya que<NL>están, se los diré"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2380",
   "src": "cc627bf28cb5",
   "t": "<FACE:01>No te hagas del rogar<NL>y dilo ya<WAIT><FACE:2B>En la ruta del Cluster<NL>hay un asteroide<WAIT>Ya lo saben por la<NL>alarma de hace un rato"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:23CA",
   "src": "10a06532248b",
   "t": "<FACE:2B>Si quieren salvarse,<NL>no se muevan de aquí<WAIT><FACE:09>¿Qué quieres decir?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:23EE",
   "src": "4ed1b786f8e0",
   "t": "<FACE:2B>Estructura y velocidad<NL>del Cluster, la masa…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2414",
   "src": "8a77e73a6ae1",
   "t": "<FACE:01>¡Déjate de discursos!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2422",
   "src": "0148a3632bba",
   "t": "<FACE:2B>Según mis cálculos,<NL>al chocar el asteroide<WAIT>el único sitio seguro<NL>es este Bloque<WAIT>Y además, el impacto<NL>lo lanzará a la Tierra"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:248B",
   "src": "0a1a7d66ca3d",
   "t": "<FACE:2B>Tuvieron suerte de<NL>encontrarnos aquí…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:24AD",
   "src": "536d6583700a",
   "t": "<FACE:04>Pero entonces, ¿y<NL>los demás…?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:24C2",
   "src": "d341be72a706",
   "t": "<FACE:2B>Eso…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:24CA",
   "src": "5f745188106c",
   "t": "<FACE:00>¿Eso?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:24D1",
   "src": "f531006929bc",
   "t": "<FACE:2D>E… eso…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:24DB",
   "src": "5dbecea16573",
   "t": "<FACE:0A>¿Eso?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:24E2",
   "src": "e25746d6157d",
   "t": "<FACE:05>…No lo habías pensado"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:24F1",
   "src": "a72ebf79db85",
   "t": "<FACE:2C>…¡Ya sé!<NL><WAIT>¡Podemos avisarles<NL>por los altavoces!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2515",
   "src": "aa8cb3adea32",
   "t": "<FACE:0B>Antes que eso, hay<NL>que evitar el choque"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:253A",
   "src": "3c288a3b9a2a",
   "t": "<FACE:03>S… sí, tienes razón…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2545",
   "src": "cbe786b6f374",
   "t": "<FACE:00>Perdón, pero vamos a<NL>seguir. ¿Se apartan?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:256D",
   "src": "4aaafb32f309",
   "t": "<FACE:2B>Es inútil: sin la<NL>tarjeta llave no pasan<WAIT>Nos apartemos o no,<NL>ustedes no avanzarán"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:25B5",
   "src": "f651cc006af7",
   "t": "<FACE:06>No me gusta nada tu<NL>manera de decirlo"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:25CF",
   "src": "779a35f5760b",
   "t": "<FACE:01>Quizá haya otro camino<NL>Por ahora, sigamos"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:25F0",
   "src": "fd2b5f8f5daf",
   "t": "<FACE:05>Tienes razón<NL><WAIT>Hagamos lo que podamos"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2605",
   "src": "e9d1a6bdc90a",
   "t": "<FACE:2D>Y yo diciendo que<NL>es inútil…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2617",
   "src": "7138fb0b690e",
   "t": "<FACE:2A>Hay deudas que se<NL>tienen que pagar…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:262A",
   "src": "1bce72ef1bd1",
   "t": "<FACE:2E>¿Eh? ¡Tensai no está!<NL><WAIT>¡Amamiya y Nadare<NL>tampoco!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2649",
   "src": "76c0ab94edb2",
   "t": "<FACE:30>…Nos dejaron atrás"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2655",
   "src": "b9c5aeb454ea",
   "t": "<FACE:00>No sé si es verdad lo<NL>que dijo Tensai,<WAIT>pero haremos lo que<NL>podamos. ¿Y ustedes?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2696",
   "src": "76c0ab94edb2",
   "t": "<FACE:30>…Nos dejaron atrás"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:26A2",
   "src": "d7dbb9416791",
   "t": "<FACE:06>¡Ay, ya!<NL>Si se fueron, ni modo"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:26C0",
   "src": "84ab1d6ee65b",
   "t": "<FACE:2E>Este siempre es así<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:26D8",
   "src": "2b1734b20168",
   "t": "<FACE:2E>Niwaka, el presidente,<NL>huyó, y para cuidarnos<WAIT>andábamos con ellos<NL><WAIT>Como ellos huyeron,<NL>ahora los seguimos"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2735",
   "src": "b1a4ca81de0e",
   "t": "<FACE:2E>¿Verdad, Shinkirou?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2746",
   "src": "76c0ab94edb2",
   "t": "<FACE:30>…Nos dejaron atrás"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2752",
   "src": "79008a873971",
   "t": "<FACE:2E>B… bueno, olvídense<NL>de este…<WAIT>¡Cuento con ustedes!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2775",
   "src": "be39a7d3864d",
   "t": "<FACE:00>Habrá que derribar<NL>la puerta<WAIT><FACE:09>Aunque digas eso…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:279A",
   "src": "9fae3191a6c8",
   "t": "<FACE:00>¡<MEDABOT>, transporte!<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:27A5",
   "src": "588de8dd2395",
   "t": "<FACE:00>¡Cuento contigo,<NL><MEDABOT>!<WAIT>¡Usa la Medafuerza!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:27B9",
   "src": "de4e7aa8e115",
   "t": "<FACE:05>Se abolló un poquito"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:27C7",
   "src": "b76e983952f9",
   "t": "<FACE:04>Mmm, no es lo mismo<NL><WAIT>Aquella vez fue<NL>mucho más increíble"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:27EC",
   "src": "a983a7b7011a",
   "t": "<FACE:03>¿Eh? ¿Se abrió la<NL>puerta?<WAIT><FACE:05>Mmm… ¿habrá servido<NL>lo de recién?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2812",
   "src": "37f69b83b465",
   "t": "<FACE:02>¡Pues claro!<NL><WAIT>¡Mi <MEDABOT><NL>es especial!<WAIT><FACE:06>¡No presumas, si lo<NL>hallaste por ahí!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:284E",
   "src": "a64e5d06185a",
   "t": "<FACE:03>Ug…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2855",
   "src": "b4edb89a7ba3",
   "t": "<FACE:0A>Vámonos ya"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2861",
   "src": "5579e11a67d1",
   "t": "<FACE:05>Parece el pasillo al<NL>sarcófago del faraón"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:288D",
   "src": "fd04ef473f6c",
   "t": "<FACE:04>(Fuu… a mí<NL> esto no me gusta…)"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:28AC",
   "src": "6d1be3207729",
   "t": "<FACE:00>¿Qué pasa?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:28B4",
   "src": "73d1f9199947",
   "t": "<FACE:03>¡Apareció algo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:28BD",
   "src": "0a3dd29128c8",
   "t": "<FACE:06>No grites así, qué<NL>vergüenza<WAIT><FACE:05>No es un fantasma…<NL>Parece un Medabot"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:28F0",
   "src": "f7da5cc01cfe",
   "t": "<FACE:02>Ah, es un Medabot<WAIT><FACE:05>No cantes victoria:<NL>viene hacia acá"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:291D",
   "src": "a2c446c54ce6",
   "t": "<FACE:00>Oye… ¿nos dejarías<NL>pasar?<WAIT>Tenemos que ir a la<NL>sala de control…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2954",
   "src": "5e81ae86a0b1",
   "t": "<FACE:05>Parece que no somos<NL>bienvenidos<WAIT><FACE:04>Los Medabots de aquí<NL>son bien tercos"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:298C",
   "src": "0e4c7c1060aa",
   "t": "<FACE:04>En este pasillo solo<NL>caben 3 de nosotros…<WAIT><FACE:01>¡Ni modo, vamos!<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:29BA",
   "src": "2d2428820353",
   "t": "<FACE:00>Lo siento por ustedes,<NL>pero aquí se duermen"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:29DC",
   "src": "7290890a9c80",
   "t": "<FACE:00>Vamos, no hay tiempo<NL>¡Rápido!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:29EF",
   "src": "aa56c34f4767",
   "t": "<FACE:00>¿Otra tarjeta llave?<WAIT><FACE:05>Pues no, parece que no<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2A11",
   "src": "ed184bbcb22e",
   "t": "<FACE:05>Mira, la seguridad de<NL>aquí lee la retina<WAIT><FACE:03>¿Eh?<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2A3E",
   "src": "0f29511618ae",
   "t": "<FACE:03>¿O sea que…?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2A49",
   "src": "f3de37e08db7",
   "t": "<FACE:05>Solo alguien de la RR<NL>y de nivel directivo<WAIT>podría abrir esta<NL>puerta, ¿no crees?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2A87",
   "src": "841a4ecd115e",
   "t": "<FACE:04>Qué problema…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2A92",
   "src": "cc3053c5c91b",
   "t": "<FACE:05>¿Ese no es Murasame<NL>Shiden?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2AA5",
   "src": "2b9be7088a37",
   "t": "<FACE:03>¿Eh?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2AAB",
   "src": "897f8a8b5f69",
   "t": "<FACE:01>¡Shiden!<WAIT><FACE:06>¡Apareciste!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2ABB",
   "src": "fc72099c33fd",
   "t": "<FACE:0F>Qué forma de hablar…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0028:2ACD",
   "src": "33993e6b62cd",
   "t": "<FACE:03>¡Cierto, Shiden!<NL><WAIT><FACE:00>Tú sí puedes abrir<NL>esta puerta, ¿no?<WAIT>¡Por favor, ábrela!<NL><WAIT>Sabes que el Cluster<NL>está en peligro, ¿no?"
